        "title": "Geospatial Analysis of the Evolution of European Tourism in Spain Using Mobile Phone Data, the Space–Time Cube, and Emerging Hot Spot Analysis",
        "authors": [
          {
            "name": "José Manuel Sánchez-Martín",
            "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4711-3542",
            "affiliation": null
